{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "6dba6d74de042ad3b4ff09c0f62a0dfb0cc76d37d0a0c21dc21badc9ad4d029a", "ja": "ケーキを食べるみたいには", "zh": "没办法像吃蛋糕那样", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6ee5a2e61e0e795a3c8807b941007a0626513f42330fa0786d3c0799e5411a92", "ja": "顔合わせに呼ばれた麗花と志保に渡されたの\nは、可愛い恋の歌。純粋に歌うのを楽しみに\nする麗花とは対称的に、志保は少し考えすぎ\nてしまっている様子。タイプの違う二人の\nデュオが楽しみなプロデューサーだった。", "zh": "被叫来碰面的丽花和志保拿到的，\n是一首可爱的恋爱歌曲。与单纯期待着享受歌唱的\n丽花相反，志保似乎有些想得太多了。\n制作人很期待这两个类型迥异的人的\n二人组合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d58d07e28fcdf21c863b16a853599c0321e364d2073cbb5737cb9c2003ce58f5", "ja": "（今日はこれから、新しいデュオの顔合わせだ。\nそろそろ約束の時間だが……）", "zh": "（今天接下来要和新的二人组合见面。\n差不多到约定的时间了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1001_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1002_033sih", "source_sha256": "9e199287f1323721ae6d0af7555ae419a625c44dd8a12daaa2b27e1fc5943366", "ja": "お疲れ様です。\nすみません、ギリギリになって。", "zh": "辛苦了。\n抱歉，直到最后一刻才赶到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "283edc504c689095795264838b0b3e1ba9e44cbf035ae434d0e8b438c385293b", "ja": "志保、お疲れ様。まだ5分前だから大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "志保，辛苦了。现在还是提前5分钟，所以没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "251eca8734a4792de51c209642d5d534b63953213fff53226561d1d3580fce4d", "ja": "いえ、私としては5分前はギリギリです。\n……まだ{$P$}さんだけですか？", "zh": "不，对我来说提前5分钟已经很极限了。\n……目前只有{$P$}先生在吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b245aee259cd6922684c2b414004e54feb57a9b84b5afb0bdef81a78eec9c9e0", "ja": "志保が一番乗りだな。\nといっても、残りはあと一人なんだけど……。", "zh": "志保是第一个到的呢。\n虽说如此，其实也就只剩一个人还没来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1006_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "2f2900c0f8b72774763d29227e9a4d6cbb3a888d529062ecb35af03408a82385", "ja": "遅れてごめんなさ～い！　まっくろなネコさんと\nにらめっこしてたら、つい夢中になっちゃって！", "zh": "迟到啦，对不起～！和一只黑漆漆的小猫对视着对视着，不知不觉就看入迷了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "6222e7196f31bc21bcc7d5e2b360f219421bcb6fcdd3862ce8f102f6e01f2a2b", "ja": "お、噂をすればだな。\nお疲れ様、麗花。", "zh": "哦，说曹操曹操到。\n辛苦了，丽花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "3a5e6c431e10b942f5d1ea33cd57d2a5b10a68060af619c1ad27be1f53fff44d", "ja": "麗花さん、お疲れ様です。\n時間には間に合ってますから大丈夫ですよ。", "zh": "丽花小姐，辛苦了。\n还来得及赶上时间，没关系的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "dd5f34ef6765fa5b321f11c065cd60b41b534b6749cda328525cee29985098c9", "ja": "あ、本当だ！　よかったぁ。\nでもお待たせしちゃってごめんね、志保ちゃん？", "zh": "啊，真的！太好了。\n不过让你等了这么久，对不起哦，志保？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "44b29fddc4f36b89e4e051101a8bf7a3970386b7a950947eb6c52b8c7d22b375", "ja": "いえ、今日は私も遅かったですから……。\nそれで、今回は麗花さんと二人の仕事なんですか？", "zh": "不是，今天我也来晚了……  \n所以，这次是要和丽花小姐两个人一起工作吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "d099a55062a337c42d6b0342250393ce8e5e47ab9b71269c7f59f1a634666342", "ja": "そうなんですか？\n志保ちゃんと二人でなんて嬉しいな♪", "zh": "这样啊？\n能和志保两个人一起工作，真开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "795c69f6ebfea8c878f9e4d0da029a7530c7b1ec264ed4481a394068d28d3e07", "ja": "ああ、二人に歌ってほしい曲があってな。\nさっそく聞いてほしいんだが……。", "zh": "啊，我有一首歌想让你们两个人一起唱。\n想让你们马上听听……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "cd9c247f0890d35ff84b4151c2e4a4eb7aa311d54f92c19ffdc63e5928502d2e", "ja": "わぁ～……♪", "zh": "哇～……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1016_033sih", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "6ab93d7ffdeec8cda0358ccd299effdfd4110e2c52ecb157e5400702ee34802a", "ja": "いい曲ですね～♪　なんだか、聞いてるだけで\nキュンキュンしてきちゃいます！", "zh": "真是一首好歌呢～♪　总觉得光是听着，\n心里就一阵阵小鹿乱撞了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "b147198e4deea40681a4ce6f08d80b39620477196791432aa90b387f8e90c521", "ja": "……涼やかで、可愛い感じの曲ですね。\n歌詞は……あ、恋の歌、ですか。", "zh": "……是一首感觉清凉又可爱的歌呢。\n歌词是……啊，是关于恋爱的歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "7fb55923987146177a769f0d44247b10e0b9fe7ad5121ff453c5adebd52aed6b", "ja": "あれ、志保は恋の歌、何度も歌ってきただろ？\nだから大丈夫だと思ったんだけど。", "zh": "咦，志保不是唱过很多次恋爱歌曲吗？\n所以我还以为应该没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1020_033sih", "source_sha256": "4b0518c06619a79bc3fb23e9f26c1285d0f665e8d97fe245dedabeeb28b727a9", "ja": "それはそうですけど……\nこれまでの曲とは、ちょっと違う感じですよね？", "zh": "话是这么说没错……\n但这首歌和之前的歌，感觉有点不一样吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1021_048rei", "source_sha256": "73bfffdb4b469850dbfec4a5141762f3d3a8df4173ed007a25115500a895cede", "ja": "そういえば志保ちゃんの恋の歌って、カッコよくて\n真剣で、重そうなのが多いもんね♪", "zh": "说起来，志保的恋爱歌曲大多都很帅气、认真，而且感觉挺沉重的呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1022_033sih", "source_sha256": "11c36bf5c5b5977a0bc55bb19887c8af2b3ce5b0af66c2700ba08305011756a0", "ja": "重……そ、そうですね。わりとそうです。", "zh": "沉……啊、是的。确实挺沉重的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1023_048rei", "source_sha256": "25f1687899485c38a36eba28d983b49000e9f41c91993552a37bc47d62fc9037", "ja": "この曲のタイトルが『piece of cake』なのも、\nそういうのとは違うところかも！", "zh": "这首歌的标题叫《piece of cake》，\n或许也和那种感觉不太一样呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1024_033sih", "source_sha256": "e36dd1467e7c54e20a94432aac6167087e1246fdd6129a481d40b1184e58b8e5", "ja": "タイトル……。もしかして『piece of cake』って\nケーキ以外に何か意味があるんですか？", "zh": "标题……难道说『piece of cake』除了蛋糕以外，还有别的意思吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1025_048rei", "source_sha256": "cb75cd249464fcc5db7c0b45736ec1bcb33d221cd048380837c986a2e05975a2", "ja": "うん、確か「簡単なこと」って意味じゃないかな♪", "zh": "嗯，我记得好像是“简单的事情”的意思吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1026_033sih", "source_sha256": "fd33131e57e58015569208d7221a1adc6ee0ce3098902169403a996e970fd136", "ja": "？　恋が、簡単なこと……？", "zh": "？恋爱是件简单的事……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1027_p", "source_sha256": "6abdd98a288f3c5af982b959d31d198ab312650038328e2ba9bd4d2e15cde097", "ja": "そうそう。だからこそ、あんまり考えすぎない方が\nいいんじゃないかな？", "zh": "对对。正因为如此，才更不该想得太多吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1028_033sih", "source_sha256": "7942107a1ecf241836c5f075be85f5ab9575beb5bf48a87b28e01276956d4c0f", "ja": "でも、考えないとわからないじゃないですか。\n実際に恋愛するわけにもいかないですし。", "zh": "但是，不去思考的话不就没法理解了吗？\n而且也不可能真的去谈恋爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1029_p", "source_sha256": "7154058e2f9fa61ba7a6405a574d825f3db4df11ab5a2af039386946ed7bb24e", "ja": "まぁ、それはそうだな。\nそれができれば簡単かもしれないけど。", "zh": "也是，你说得对。\n要是能那样做或许就简单了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1030_048rei", "source_sha256": "5e77d651d86685948c834e86db9d243c09ed10f83f33ecc600d104a97fd45a3b", "ja": "うんうん。\n簡単なことって、すっごく難しいんですよね。", "zh": "嗯嗯。\n简单的事情，往往特别难做到呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1031_048rei", "source_sha256": "319e4bc23cdd1f3821852f982294b9f10854e8167f01e9eee9cc9c62df2e4abf", "ja": "だから、それが不思議だったり、\nもどかしかったりするのかも♪", "zh": "所以，才会觉得不可思议，\n又有点着急吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1032_033sih", "source_sha256": "9b09ac1937d296a21d3405d28f14662e536bf305bcc8697ecf124a52bb551363", "ja": "よく、わからないですけど……麗花さんはもう、\nこの曲のこと、よくわかってるんですね。", "zh": "我虽然不是很明白……不过丽花小姐，\n好像已经很懂这首歌了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1033_048rei", "source_sha256": "597da9597a81bb01560885e088210afd78f56bf07510976edf1ae03df9141e47", "ja": "そうなのかな？　でもすっごくいい曲だよね！\n志保ちゃんとステージで歌うの、楽しみだな～♪", "zh": "是这样吗？不过这首歌真的很棒呢！能和志保在舞台上一起唱，我很期待哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1034_033sih", "source_sha256": "98e1fe2fe6bfcd68f8a47ee234810ace453b2c07e334d046bc6b3217abd16ac7", "ja": "それは、私もですけど……。", "zh": "我也是，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1035_p", "source_sha256": "056fae4c6b16d8315fe0433e10b7b716e60dd7d7135726bfec977a6521552fd9", "ja": "まぁまぁ。歌ってみてわかることもあるだろうし、\n今日は早速……。", "zh": "好啦好啦。试着唱唱，说不定也能明白些什么，  \n今天就马上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1036_048rei", "source_sha256": "1da1da88806b45b8c10083ebf446f2d94488a6de80ab88e47552a65b2712aa5f", "ja": "はい、デュオ結成記念パーティーですね！\n志保ちゃん、ケーキでも食べに行こっか♪", "zh": "对，是庆祝双人组合成立的派对呢！  \n志保，我们去吃蛋糕吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1037_p", "source_sha256": "a2094c03d9edf69163303335ef8a589b5e42db6048881abdebd76993c1fa667b", "ja": "あ、いや、今日は早速\nレッスンはどうかな、と……。", "zh": "啊，不是，那个……我是想说，今天要不要马上开始练习……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1038_048rei", "source_sha256": "3760999b72123ebfb1d6f63970f1bb34b7846b33a0e95847e0a3f7a08b503ff6", "ja": "えっ、そうだったんですか？\nじゃあケーキはいつにしましょう？", "zh": "诶，原来是这样吗？\n那蛋糕安排在什么时候呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1039_033sih", "source_sha256": "87f9b0abcff1de23be6f404e90455440146b403367a03a0fa5f3659498b67a1d", "ja": "今日は、私もレッスンに一票です。麗花さんが\nこの曲をどう歌うのか、聞いてみたいですし。", "zh": "今天我也赞成上课。因为我也想听听丽花会怎么唱这首歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1040_033sih", "source_sha256": "129d3fc4fb7a39a71d201dd89414b6a20cb5e094731b2f17b9d4126ab10e9438", "ja": "ケーキは……\n公演が成功したら食べに行きませんか？", "zh": "蛋糕的话……\n等公演成功后，要不要一起去吃？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1041_048rei", "source_sha256": "542756dedfaf309858ceed1e5243a82bf9a0b883f80e38ecac9632595b5e909d", "ja": "うん、約束だよ！\nというわけで、今日はレッスン頑張ろー！", "zh": "嗯，说好啦！\n所以呢，今天也要好好努力练习哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_01_1042_p", "source_sha256": "27899a4458945869c269abe1587f7dc17b27d2043207d8962ad3a8321995ad6a", "ja": "（志保と麗花。タイプの違う二人がどんなハーモニーを\n聞かせてくれるのか……楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（志保和丽花，这两个类型完全不同的人会带来怎样的和声呢……真让人期待啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
